OL,3,GNEWSACharity sells sports centre amid
OL,4,Acosts struggle
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity's sports centre has been put
OL,7,Fup for sale because it can no longer
OL,8,Fafford to run the venue.
OL,10,FCrook's community leisure centre opened
OL,11,Fin 2017 and provided an exercise space
OL,12,Ffor local residents, community groups
OL,13,Fand junior sports teams.
OL,15,FHowever, the charity's trustees said it
OL,16,Fwas struggling to subsidise the centre
OL,17,Fdue to rising energy and utility costs,
OL,18,Fincreases to the minimum wage and
OL,19,Fnational insurance payments, and the
OL,20,Fmaintenance of the ageing site.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
